{"id":8,"title":"测试：python核心知识","summary":"本小课中最后一个检测，看下你掌握如何","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f9931d5ef29411ebb1043af9d3c2d1d5","title":"python核心知识回顾检测","title_html":"<p>python核心知识回顾检测</p>\n","render_mode":"continuous","questions":[{"question_id":1,"question_type":"mult_choice","question_text":"下面哪几个选项将浮点数3赋值给了变量`a`(可能有多个答案)？","question_text_html":"<p>下面哪几个选项将浮点数3赋值给了变量<code>a</code>(可能有多个答案)？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"`a = 3.0`","text_html":"<p><code>a = 3.0</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"`a = 3`","text_html":"<p><code>a = 3</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`a` 是 `int` 类型","md_html":"<p><code>a</code> 是 <code>int</code> 类型</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"`a = float(3)`","text_html":"<p><code>a = float(3)</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"`a = float('three')`","text_html":"<p><code>a = float('three')</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"错误: 无法将字符串转换为浮点数","md_html":"<p>错误: 无法将字符串转换为浮点数</p>\n"},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":2,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下列哪一种是编写多行字符串的惯用方法？","question_text_html":"<p>下列哪一种是编写多行字符串的惯用方法？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"`\"Hello\\nWorld\"`","text_html":"<p><code>&quot;Hello\\nWorld&quot;</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"产生了多行字符串，但不是惯用方法。","md_html":"<p>产生了多行字符串，但不是惯用方法。</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\n'Hello\nWorld'\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>'Hello\nWorld'\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"将无法解析。只有单行字符串。","md_html":"<p>将无法解析。只有单行字符串。</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\n'''Hello\nWorld'''\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>'''Hello\nWorld'''\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":3,"question_type":"mult_choice","question_text":"以下哪几个选项是Python `if`语句的正确语法？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪几个选项是Python <code>if</code>语句的正确语法？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"```python3\nif (x == 1)\n{ \n    pass\n}\n```","text_html":"<pre><code class=\"language-python3\">if (x == 1)\n{ \n    pass\n}\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"在Python中，大括号不用于代码块","md_html":"<p>在Python中，大括号不用于代码块</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\nif x == 1:\npass\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>if x == 1:\npass\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"解析将失败，因为`pass`没有缩进","md_html":"<p>解析将失败，因为<code>pass</code>没有缩进</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\nif (x == 1): pass\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>if (x == 1): pass\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"括号在这里是合法的，但是是可选的。只有当我们需要强制执行操作顺序时才需要。同一行的 \"pass \"是合法的","md_html":"<p>括号在这里是合法的，但是是可选的。只有当我们需要强制执行操作顺序时才需要。同一行的 &quot;pass &quot;是合法的</p>\n"},"correct":true},{"text":"```\nif x == 1:\n    pass\n````","text_html":"<pre><code>if x == 1:\n    pass\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"这是标准的写法。","md_html":"<p>这是标准的写法。</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":4,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下面的代码会打印什么？\n\n```\ny = [x for x in range(10, 0, -2)]\nprint(y)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>下面的代码会打印什么？</p>\n<pre><code>y = [x for x in range(10, 0, -2)]\nprint(y)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"`[8, 6, 4, 2, 0]`","text_html":"<p><code>[8, 6, 4, 2, 0]</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"`[9, 7, 5, 3, 1]`","text_html":"<p><code>[9, 7, 5, 3, 1]</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"`[10, 8, 6, 4, 2, 0]`","text_html":"<p><code>[10, 8, 6, 4, 2, 0]</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"`[10, 8, 6, 4, 2]`","text_html":"<p><code>[10, 8, 6, 4, 2]</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`range()`包括其第一个参数，不包括其第二个参数。","md_html":"<p><code>range()</code>包括其第一个参数，不包括其第二个参数。</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":5,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪项是对Python函数的正确定义？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪项是对Python函数的正确定义？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"```\ndef f(int x, int y):\n    return x + y\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>def f(int x, int y):\n    return x + y\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"参数类型不需要","md_html":"<p>参数类型不需要</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\nint f(x, y):\n    return x + y\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>int f(x, y):\n    return x + y\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"不需要返回类型","md_html":"<p>不需要返回类型</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\ndef f(x, y):\n    return x + y\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>def f(x, y):\n    return x + y\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":6,"question_type":"mult_choice","question_text":"下面哪几个选项定义了一个类，并且赋值1到实例化对象上了? ","question_text_html":"<p>下面哪几个选项定义了一个类，并且赋值1到实例化对象上了?</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"```\nclass A:\n    def __init__(self):\n        A.x = 1\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>class A:\n    def __init__(self):\n        A.x = 1\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`x` 是一个类变量","md_html":"<p><code>x</code> 是一个类变量</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\nclass A:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.x = 1\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>class A:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.x = 1\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"需要\"self \"来分配一个实例变量","md_html":"<p>需要&quot;self &quot;来分配一个实例变量</p>\n"},"correct":true},{"text":"```\nclass A:\n    x = 1\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>class A:\n    x = 1\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`x` 为类变量","md_html":"<p><code>x</code> 为类变量</p>\n"},"correct":false},{"text":"```\nclass A:\n    pass\n\na = A()\na.x = 1\n```","text_html":"<pre><code>class A:\n    pass\n\na = A()\na.x = 1\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"实例变量`x`在a被创建后被动态绑定","md_html":"<p>实例变量<code>x</code>在a被创建后被动态绑定</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":7,"question_type":"mult_choice","question_text":"以下哪些函数提供关于一个对象的运行时信息？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪些函数提供关于一个对象的运行时信息？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"`dir(x)`","text_html":"<p><code>dir(x)</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"`type(x)`","text_html":"<p><code>type(x)</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"`introspect(x)`","text_html":"<p><code>introspect(x)</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"`info(x)`","text_html":"<p><code>info(x)</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0}],"status":"undo","course_no":"001","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/001/page/8"}
